alter table taxon_synonym enable row level security; alter table biological_entity enable row level security; alter table vocabulary_term enable row level security; alter table interaction_reference enable row level security; alter table interaction_geography enable row level security; alter table evolutionary_origin enable row level security; alter table interaction_origin enable row level security; alter table candidate enable row level security;
